.TH QDOCK-PROBE 1 "September 2026" "0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qdock-probe \- read-only Quansheng serial and capture diagnostic tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qdock-probe
.RI "--replay file | --port device | --list-ports " [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decode Quansheng Dock frames from a capture or serial device.
Prints events as JSON lines. Does not send radio commands.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Show complete usage and options.
.TP
.B --list-ports
List serial devices without opening them.
.TP
.BI "--port " device
Listen on the specified serial port.
.TP
.BI "--seconds " number
Duration of serial acquisition.
.TP
.BI "--capture " file
Save raw incoming bytes to a new file, refusing to overwrite an existing capture.
.TP
.BI "--replay " file
Decode a binary capture without radio access.
.SH NOTES
Close other programs using the serial port before acquisition.
Candidate UI events are observations, not verified RF measurements.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qdock-server (1)
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/qdock-server/README.md
